==== 3.6.4 HBM 테스트 흐름과 PE 관문

```text
 [core die wafer EDS]   -> KGD (retention / speed / hot / low-V corners)
        |
 [thinning / TSV reveal] -> TSV resistance TEG, wafer warpage
        |
 [stack on base die]     -> per-tier channel continuity (optional mid-test)
        |
 [stack done -> KGSD]    -> DA port / IEEE 1500: all channels, margin, temp
        |
 [customer interposer]   -> system-level test (next to GPU, real thermal)
```

